{"unit_id": "tag:03RN:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们的下一步是使用 Kummer 序列（Kummer sequence），推导曲线（curve）的有限（finite）系数（coefficients）上同调（cohomology）群（group）的一些信息。为了在长正合列（exact sequence）中得到消失性，我们回顾关于 Picard 群（Picard groups）的一些事实。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>为光滑（smooth）射影（projective）曲线（curve），定义于代数闭（algebraically closed）域（field）<MATH_0002>上。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>的亏格（genus）。存在短正合列（short exact sequence）<MATH_0005>阿贝尔群（abelian group）<MATH_0006>可等同于<MATH_0007>，即取值于<MATH_0008>的点（points），来自阿贝尔（abelian）簇（variety）<MATH_0009>，后者定义于<MATH_0010>上，维数（dimension）为<MATH_0011>。因此，若<MATH_0012>，则有<MATH_0013>作为阿贝尔群（abelian groups）。参见《曲线（Curves）的 Picard 概形（Picard Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节及《群胚（Groupoids）》第<REF_0002>节。这一关键事实，即对代数闭（algebraically closed）域（field）上的光滑（smooth）射影（projective）曲线（curve）的 Picard 群（Picard group）中扭元（torsion）的描述，似乎没有初等证明。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Kummer sequence", "target_term": "Kummer 序列"}, {"source_term": "curve", "target_term": "曲线"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "coefficients", "target_term": "系数"}, {"source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "exact sequence", "target_term": "正合列"}, {"source_term": "Picard groups", "target_term": "Picard 群"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "curve", "target_term": "曲线"}, {"source_term": "algebraically closed", "target_term": "代数闭"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "genus", "target_term": "亏格"}, {"source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "variety", "target_term": "簇"}, {"source_term": "dimension", "target_term": "维数"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_ter